  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. <br>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.<br>• Slice pumpkin into thin wedges.<br>• Slice zucchini into rounds.<br>• Cut red onion and tomato into wedges.<br>• Slice lemon into wedges.<br>• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray, drizzle with <br>olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat. Roast <br>until tender, 20-25 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895829b6ffa7a20c3beb42/step-8ff94000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Place zucchini, onion and tomato on a second lined <br>oven tray.<br>• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to <br>coat. Roast until tender, 15-20 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895829b6ffa7a20c3beb42/step-2999eb10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While veggies are roasting, finely chop garlic. <br>• Pick thyme leaves. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895829b6ffa7a20c3beb42/step-cd1fb520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over <br>medium-high heat. Add Nan&#39;s special seasoning <br>and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895829b6ffa7a20c3beb42/step-a907ac30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To the saucepan, stir in risoni, stock concentrate, <br>light cooking cream and the boiling water <br>(see ingredients). Bring to the boil, then reduce <br>heat to medium and simmer, stirring occasionally, <br>until risoni is ‘al dente’ and water is absorbed, <br>12-15 minutes.<br>TIP: Rest risoni, covered, for 5 minutes to thicken.<br>TIP: Add a splash more water if the risoni looks dry! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895829b6ffa7a20c3beb42/step-24944e40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Gently stir roast veggies through risoni.<br>• Divide risoni between bowls.<br>• Top with roast pumpkin. Drizzle the honey over <br>roast pumpkin. <br>• Crumble over marinated goat cheese and garnish <br>with thyme to serve. Enjoy!<br>TIP: Keeping a portion for later? See storage and <br>re-heating instructions under allergens! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895829b6ffa7a20c3beb42/step-ccb6f350.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
